# This directory is intentionally left empty (placeholder for model weights).
# Git-tracked via this file; the actual .pt files are gitignored.
#
# Expected files (place manually after download):
#   models/yolov8n.pt        — YOLOv8 nano (phone / paper detection)
#   models/yolov8-face.pt    — YOLOv8 face detector
#
# Download commands:
#   pip install ultralytics
#   python -c "from ultralytics import YOLO; YOLO('yolov8n.pt')"
#
# The downloaded .pt file will appear in your current directory.
# Move it here:
#   mv yolov8n.pt myproject_backend/hardware/ai_engine/models/yolov8n.pt
